<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id" />
  <para style="h">AMOC</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Amoc</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amoc</para>
  <para style="toc3">Amo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMOC</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Amoc obedo lanebi mukwongo i Baibul ma kwenane kicoyo kore ki kore. En oa ki i taun me Tekoa matye i Juda ento en otito lok pa Lubanga bot jo Icrael ma gitye i ker matye tung kumalo. Kadi bed kitmeno kwenane mako jo Icrael ducu. Man otime ikine me mwaka miya abiro ki pyere abicel nio kwede wa mwaka miya abiro ki pyere abic ma pud peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito ikare me loc pa Ujia ki Jeroboam.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amoc otito lok pa Lubanga ikare ma dano tye ki lonyo madwong adada. Ento Amoc oneno ni lim onongo tye bot lulonyo keken dok gin bene tye kaunu ki diyo lucan. Woro Lubanga onongo pe tye kakare. Lok me kuc ki tungcel onongo nen calo gin matye, ento i adane kuc onongo peke.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amoc obedo ki miti dok ki kero madit adada me tito ni Lubanga bimiyo pwod bot jo Icrael ka pe gungut. Piman en owaco ni, jo pa Lubanga omyero guwek ngolo kop ma atir obed tye, dok omol calo pii ma i kulu. Dong ka gin oloko kwogi ci, “Gwok onyo Rwot Lubanga me mony, bitimo kica bot jo lobo Icrael ma odong ma pud kwo.” 5:15</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngolo kop ikom rok ma orumu jo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="AMO 1:1-2:5">1:1—2:5</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngolo kop ikom jo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="AMO 2:6-6:14">2:6—6:14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ginanyuta abic mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="AMO 7:1-9:15">7:1—9:15</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="AMO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">2 Luk 15:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:1-23">2 Tek 26:1-23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:23-29">2 Luk 14:23-29</ref></char>
    </note> Man aye lok pa Amoc, ma en yam ngat acel ikin lukwat romi me Tekoa, ma en oloko lok ikom Icrael ikare me loc pa Ujia rwot me Juda, ki ikare me loc pa Jeroboam wod pa Yoaci rwot me Icrael. Inge lok pa Amoc, okato mwaka aryo ci oyengyeng otime.<verse eid="AMO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:16">Joe 3:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Amoc owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:2">“Rwot mor ki i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:2">dwone winye ki i Jerucalem;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:2">olet pa lukwat otwo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:2">lum ma iwi got Karmel bene oner woko.”<verse eid="AMO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom rok ma orumu jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="s2">Ciria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:1-3">Ica 17:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Jer 49:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1">Jek 9:1</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Pi lwak bal mapol pa jo Damaciko, pe abidwoko cwinya cen i pwod ma abimiyogi, pien gin gutimo tim me gero marac ikom jo Gilead. <verse eid="AMO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 1:4" />Kumeno abicwalo mac ikom ot pa Kajael, ci biwango odi madongo ma i gangkal pa Benadad. <verse eid="AMO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 1:5" />Abituru larii dog gang me Damaciko, abityeko jo ma bedo i nota Aven, ki laloc ma i Bet-eden. Ci jo Ciria kibiterogi i opii i lobo Kir.”<verse eid="AMO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Pilictia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Ica 14:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Jer 47:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Eje 25:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Jep 2:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Jek 9:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Pi lwak bal mapol pa jo Gaja, pe abidwoko cwinya cen i pwod ma abimiyogi; pien gutero roka woko kulu i opii, ci gumiyogi i cing Edom. <verse eid="AMO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 1:7" />Kumeno abicwalo mac ikom taun madit me Gaja, biwango odine matego woko ducu. <verse eid="AMO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 1:8" />Abityeko jo ma bedo i Acidod woko, ki laloc ma i Acikelon. Abitingo cinga ikom Ekron, ki jo Piliciti ma gudong gibitum woko. Man an Rwot Lubanga aye awaco.”<verse eid="AMO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Turo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Ica 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-9">Eje 26:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-4">Jek 9:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat 11:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luk 10:13-14</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Pi lwak bal mapol pa jo Turo, pe abiloko tama i pwod ma abimiyogi; pien gin gumiyo rok woko kulu i cing jo Edom, wigi pe opo ikom gicikegi me omego. <verse eid="AMO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 1:10" />Kumeno abicwalo mac ikom cel me Turo, biwango odine matego woko ducu.”<verse eid="AMO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Edom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Ica 34:5-17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eje 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1:2-5</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Pi lwak bal mapol pa jo Edom, pe abiloko tama i pwod ma abimiyogi; pien guryemo kor Icrael ki pala lucwan, gubolo kica woko ducu, kinigagi obedo lyet nakanaka, gin gukano akemogi obedo matwal. <verse eid="AMO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 1:12" />Kumeno abicwalo mac ikom Teman, biwango odi matego me Bojra.”<verse eid="AMO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ammon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:1-6">Jer 49:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:28-32">Eje 21:28-32</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:1-7">25:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Jep 2:8-11</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Pi lwak bal mapol pa jo Ammon, pe abidwoko cwinya cen i pwod ma abimiyogi; pien gubaro i mon Gilead ma guyac, pi medo wang lobogi. <verse eid="AMO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 1:14" />Kumeno abicwinyo mac ikom cel me Raba, biwango odine matego woko ducu, ci woo madwong biwinye kunu ikare me lweny, woo madwong macalo yamo lapiru mager. <verse eid="AMO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 1:15" />Rwotgi kibitero i opii, en kacel ki lutice ducu bicito i opii. Man an Rwot aye ma awaco.”<verse eid="AMO 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="AMO 2" />
  <para style="s2">Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 15:1-9">Ica 15:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">25:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Jer 48:1-47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Eje 25:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Jep 2:8-11</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Pi lwak bal mapol pa jo Moab, pe abidwoko cwinya cen i pwod ma abimiyogi; pien guwango cogo pa rwot me Edom odoko buru. <verse eid="AMO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 2:2" />Kumeno abicwalo mac ikom Moab, ci biwango odi matego ducu me Keriot. Jo Moab bito i woo madwong me lweny ma nongo acikari gidange, ma obute lweny kok malongo. <verse eid="AMO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 2:3" />Abineko latela me Moab, ki abineko lutice ducu kacel kwede. Man an Rwot aye ma awaco.”<verse eid="AMO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 2:4" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Pi lwak bal mapol pa jo Juda, pe abidwoko cwinya cen i pwod ma abimiyogi; pien gukwero lubu cik ma mera, pe gugwoko lok ma an aciko. Jokgi me goba mayam kwarigi gulubu orwenyogi woko ki i yo. <verse eid="AMO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 2:5" />Kumeno abicwalo mac ikom Juda, biwango odi matego ducu me Jerucalem.”<verse eid="AMO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 2:6" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Pi lwak bal mapol pa jo Icrael, pe abidwoko cwinya cen i pwod ma abimiyogi; pien gicato dano ma kite atir pi lim, dano ma piny obwoyo, wel ma kiwile kwede rom ki wel me wilo war tyen. <verse eid="AMO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 2:7" />Ginyono wi lucan i apwa me ngom, gigengo yoo ki jo ma gin lucan. Awobi ribe ki wone me butu ki angeca acel, miyo balo nyinga malengi. <verse eid="AMO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 2:8" />Gibutu girumu nget keno tyer woko ducu ikom bongi ma kijengo botgi; gimato kongo bwino pa jo ma gungolo cul ikomgi i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="AMO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:8-11">Nwo 3:8-11</ref></char></note>Ento yam atyeko jo Amor ki inyimgi, mayam giboco calo yat cedar, ma gitego calo kworo. Atyeko nyige ki malo, wa ki lwite piny. <verse eid="AMO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 2:10" />An kono ceng akwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, atelowu i tim pi mwaka pyere angwen kulu, wek wucam lobo pa jo Amor. <verse eid="AMO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:1-8">Wel 6:1-8</ref></char></note>Adyero lutinowu mogo pi bedo lunebi, ayero awobewu mogo pi bedo lutic ma mera kikome. Meno pe tye lok ada, wun jo Icrael? An Rwot kikome aye aloko. <verse eid="AMO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 2:12" />Ento wuweko jo ma gudyere pi tic bot Lubanga gudoko lumat kongo bwino, wuciko lunebi kun wuwaco ni, ‘Pe wutit lok pa Lubanga.’ <verse eid="AMO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 2:13" />Nen, abinginyowu woko piny i kabedowu, calo gadigadi ma lwiny piny ma opong ki nyig kal. <verse eid="AMO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 2:14" />Kadi wa langwec madwir atika pe biloyo, latekkom tekone birweny, twon oteka lweny pe bilaro kwone. <verse eid="AMO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 2:15" />Lamak atum pe bicung, ngat ma tyene dwir pe bilare, kadi ngat ma ringo ki aguragura pe bilaro kwone. <verse eid="AMO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 2:16" />Ngat ma cwinye nwang ikin oteka lweny bingwec woko munero inino meno. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="AMO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="AMO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 3:1" />Wuwiny lok ma Rwot dong oloko ikomwu, wun jo Icrael, ikom kakawu ducu mayam okwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt: <verse eid="AMO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 3:2" />“Wun keken aye angeyowu ki ikin kaka ducu ma iwi lobo; pimeno abiketo can ikomwu pi balwu ducu.”<verse eid="AMO 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tic pa lanebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 3:3" />Itamoni jo aryo gitwero cako wot kacel ma pe guyubu lok me rwate?<verse eid="AMO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 3:4" />Itamo ni labwor kok ki i bunga ka pe omako lee?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:4">Latin labwor mono kok ki i boro ka pe omako lee mo?<verse eid="AMO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 3:5" />Itamo ni winyo moko ki labal ka pe kitero owic pire?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:5">Owic mono tuk nono ki i ngom ka pe gin mo ogudu?<verse eid="AMO 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 3:6" />Ka kikutu obute i gang, ci lworo pe mako dano?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:6">Itamo ni gin marac twero poto i gang ma Rwot aye pe ocwalo?<verse eid="AMO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 3:7" />Adada Rwot Lubanga pe timo gin mo, labongo yabo munge bot lutice ma lunebi.<verse eid="AMO 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 3:8" />Ka labwor dong okok; ci anga ma lworo pe mako?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:8">Rwot Lubanga dong oloko; dong anga ma twero kwero tito loke?<verse eid="AMO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto ikom Camaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 3:9" />Wutuc lok bot jo ma gibedo i odi ker ma i Aciria, ki i odi ker ma i lobo Ejipt. Wuwac ni, “Wugure kacel iwi godi me Camaria, wunen arubaruba madwong ma iye, ki kit ma kiunu kwede dano i gang meno.”<verse eid="AMO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 3:10" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Jo man gipongo odigi madongo ki jami ma guyako ki gero, dok pe bene gingeyo timo gin matye atir. <verse eid="AMO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 3:11" />Pimeno lakwor birumu lobogi, bidwoko tekgi woko piny; ci odigi madongo kibiyako woko.”<verse eid="AMO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 3:12" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Macalo lakwat laro tyen romo aryo, nyo dul it, ki i dog labwor, kitmeno bene jo mo manok keken ma gibedo i Camaria aye kibilarogi, ki ikin jo ma gibutu ki kuc iwi kom me wel. <verse eid="AMO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 3:13" />Wuwiny, ci wubed caden ikom ot pa Yakobo, man Rwot Lubanga me mony aye awaco. <verse eid="AMO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:15">2 Luk 23:15</ref></char></note> Ikom nino ma abimiyo pwod ki jo Icrael pi balgi, abibalo keno tyer me Betel woko. Ten keno tyer kibiturugi woko ci poto piny i ngom. <verse eid="AMO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 3:15" />Abigoyo odi me cwir wa ki me oro; odi ma kideyo ki lak lyec kibimukugi woko, odi madongo kibimuku. Man lok pa an Rwot kikome.<verse eid="AMO 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="AMO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 4:1" />Wuwiny lok man, wun mon me Camaria, ma wucwe calo dyangi me Bacan. Wun mon ma wuburu lucan, ma wudiyo jo ma piny obwoyogi, wun ma wuwaco bot cogwu ni, ‘Wukel kongo, wek wamati!’ <verse eid="AMO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 4:2" />Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni, ‘Pien an kita tye atir, dong akwonge ni kare tye kabino ikomwu ma kibiywayowu woko ki goli calo rec, wun kacel ki jowu ma lacen; ci kibiterowu woko wa i lobo pa merokwu. <verse eid="AMO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 4:3" />Kibiywayowu woko ki i wang cel ma kimuku, ci kibibolowu woko i Armon.’”<verse eid="AMO 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael pe guye pwony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 4:4" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Wun jo Icrael wucit i kabedo maleng i Betel, wek wumede ki timo bal; wucit i Gilgal, ci wumede ki timo bal ki keruwu ducu; wukel gitumwu rupiny ki rupiny, wumii dul acel me aparwu inge nino adekadek. <verse eid="AMO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 4:5" />Wutyer gitum me pwoc ki mugati ma kirubu iye tobi, wutit pi gityerwu ma iwu opwoyo wek lwak guwiny; pien wun jo Icrael wumaro timo kumeno!<verse eid="AMO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 4:6" />Yam amiyo kec opoto i gangiwu ducu, amiyo kwon oremowu i kabedowu ducu, ento wun dong pe wumedo ki dwogo bota matwal. <verse eid="AMO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 4:7" />An bene yam atwonowu kot ikare ma onongo kot myero ocwer i potiwu; amiyo kot ocwer i taun madit acel, ento pe amiyo cwer i taun madito mukene; poto acel kot cwer iye, ento poto mukene kot pe cwer iye, oweko camwu gutwo woko. <verse eid="AMO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 4:8" />Jo me taun madito aryo nyo adek gucito i taun madit mukene, kayenyo pii, ci pe gunongo pii ma oromogi; ento wun dong pe wumedo ki dwogo bota matwal. Man lok pa an Rwot kikome.<verse eid="AMO 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 4:9" />Yam apwodowu, kun acwalo kwidi i potiwu, amiyo belwu odoko ocone, aweko potiwu ki poto olokwu otwo woko, bonyo gucamo oduru ki yadi jeituniwu; ento wun pe wumedo ki dwogo bota matwal.<verse eid="AMO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 4:10" />Yam acwalo two gemo ikomwu macalo two gemo me Ejipt; aneko awobewu ki pala lucwan, ayako aguragurawu mapol; ma omiyo ngwec gonywu oduny i umwu ma ngwe; ento wun pe wumedo ki dwogo bota matwal.<verse eid="AMO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 4:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Aca 19:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yam atyeko jo mogo ma ikinwu, kit macalo yam atyeko kwede Codom ki Gomora; jo ma obwot ki ikinwu onongo obedo calo dog yen ma kikwanyo ki i mac; ento wun pe wumedo ki dwogo bota matwal.<verse eid="AMO 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 4:12" />Pimeno, wun jo Icrael, abitimowu kit man; dong wuyube pi rwate kweda, wun jo Icrael, pien abiketo pwod ikomwu.”<verse eid="AMO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 4:13" />Lubanga en ngat ma ocweyo godi ki oketo yamo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">En weko tame ngene bot dano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">Lubanga loko rupiny doko piny macol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">dok woto ki malo iwi lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">nyinge Rwot Lubanga me mony!<verse eid="AMO 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="AMO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Wungut wek wubed kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 5:1" />Wuwiny wun jo Icrael, wuwiny lok man ma aloko ikomwu calo wer lyel:<verse eid="AMO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 5:2" />Icrael ma pud rinini dong otyeko poto woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:2">pe dok bia;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:2">dong kityeko kwere woko i lobone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:2">ngat mo peke ma ile malo.<verse eid="AMO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 5:3" />Rwot Lubanga waco kuman ni, “Ikare ma merokwu bioto mony ikomwu, wubitero jo alip i lweny ento wubidong ki dano miya keken; taun madit mukene bitero jo miya ento bidong ki dano apar keken.”<verse eid="AMO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 5:4" />Rwot owaco bot jo me Icrael ni, “Wubin bota, wek wubed kwo. <verse eid="AMO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 5:5" />Pe wubed kawot i Betel, wuwek donyo i Gilgal, pe wukat wa i Beer-ceba; pien Gilgal kibitero woko i opii, ki Betel bidoko gin ma konye peke.”<verse eid="AMO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 5:6" />Wubin bot Rwot, wek wubed kwo, ka pe ci en bityeko jo me ot pa Yucepu calo mac ma wango piny woko liweng, labongo ngat mo i Betel maromo nekone. <verse eid="AMO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 5:7" />Wubineno can wun jo ma wungolo kop kilong, ma ka ngolo kop atir, wubolo kit ma atir woko piny.<verse eid="AMO 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:9">Yub 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:31">38:31</ref></char>
    </note> Ngat ma otiyo lakalatwe, Yoggo ki Lyernyim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:8">ngat maloko colpiny doko odiko, ki dyeceng doko wor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:8">ngat ma lwongo pii me nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:8">ci coro woko iwi lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:8">nyinge Rwot.<verse eid="AMO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 5:9" />En balo gedo matek kun nginyo woko macalo lutkot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:9">miyo kituru cel gogo kinginyo woko.<verse eid="AMO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 5:10" />Wun wudag ngat ma jukuwu ki kama kingolo iye kop atir, cwinywu kwero ngat maloko lok ada. <verse eid="AMO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 5:11" />Pien wun wudiyo lucan kun wujogo nyig kal ki botgi tektek, pimeno kadi bed wugero odiwu ki gweng apaya, pe wubibedo i igi; dok kadi bed wupito olok i potiwu ma yomo cwinywu, pe wubimato kongo bwinone. <verse eid="AMO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 5:12" />Pien angeyo ni wutimo bal mapol, angeyo kit balwu madongo ducu, kit ma wuyelo ki jo ma kitgi atir, kun wugamo lim me wilowu, ci wuryemo jo ma piny obwoyo ki i kabedo me ngolo kop. <verse eid="AMO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 5:13" />Pieno ngat ma laryeko biling alinga ikare ma kitmeno, pien karene rac mada.<verse eid="AMO 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 5:14" />Wulub gin maber, pe gin marac, wek wubed kwo; kumeno, Rwot ma en aye Lubanga me mony, bibedo kwedwu, kit macalo wun wuwaconi. <verse eid="AMO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 5:15" />Wukwer gin marac, wumar gin maber, wumii kingol kop atir i otkot; gwok nyo Rwot, ma Lubanga me mony, bibedo ki kica bot jo pa Yucepu ma gudong.<verse eid="AMO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 5:16" />Pimeno Rwot Lubanga me mony ma en Rwot, owaco kuman ni, “Koko bibedo i dyekal ducu; i wanga yoo ducu dano bikok ni, ‘Aya! Aya!’ Kibilwongo lupur ni gubin kakumu, ki jo ma ngeyo wer lyel wek gubin, ci gukok. <verse eid="AMO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 5:17" />Koko bibedo wa i poto olok ducu, pien abikato awok ki i dyewu, pi pwodowu. Man an Rwot aye awaco.”<verse eid="AMO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="AMO 5:18" />Wun jo ma wumito nino pa Rwot komwu kec! Pingo wumito nino pa Rwot? Piny bibedo col inino meno labongo dero mo. <verse eid="AMO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="AMO 5:19" />Bibedo rom ki dano ma oringo labwor, dok orwate ki kwac; nyo odonyo i ot ci ojengo bade ikom kicika, ci twol dok otonge. <verse eid="AMO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="AMO 5:20" />Inino pa Rwot, piny bibedo col aye, ma dero mo peke, piny bicido woko licuc, gin mo ma meny iye bibedo peke.<verse eid="AMO 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="AMO 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:11-14">Ica 1:11-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot waco kuman ni, “Cwinya dag karamawu me nino madito, acayogi woko, cokewu me wora pe yomo cwinya wa ki acel. <verse eid="AMO 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="AMO 5:22" />Kadi bed wutyero bota gitum awanga ki gityer me moko kwon, pe abigamogi; wa gityer lakwecwinywu me lim ma ocwe pe abiciko iye wanga. <verse eid="AMO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="AMO 5:23" />Wukwany woo me werwu woko ki bota; pe abiwinyo dwon nangawu kadi ki acel. <verse eid="AMO 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="AMO 5:24" />Ento wuwek ngolo kop atir aye omol macalo pii, kitwu obed atir calo kulu ma mol nakanaka ma pe two.<verse eid="AMO 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="AMO 5:25" />Wun jo me ot pa Icrael, ikare mayam kwariwu gubedo kawire i dye tim aroo pi mwaka pyere angwen ca, onongo kong alegogi ni gukel bota gitum ki gityer? <verse eid="AMO 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="AMO 5:26" />Pe kumeno, ento koni dong wutye kaworo cal pa Cakkut ma rwotwu, ki Kaiwan, lubangawu ma lakalatwe, ki cal jogiwu ducu ma wupayo pirwu kenwu. <verse eid="AMO 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="AMO 5:27" />Pimeno abiryemowu woko i opii wa inge Damaciko.” Man Rwot ma en Lubanga me mony aye owaco.<verse eid="AMO 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="AMO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kibibalo lobo Icrael woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 6:1" />Wubineno can, wun jo ma wutye agonya i Cion, wubineno can wun jo ma wutamo ni wutye ki kuc iwi got me Camaria, wun luloc madito me Icrael, ma jo Icrael ducu gibino botwu pi nongo kony. <verse eid="AMO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 6:2" />Kong wucit wunen taun madit me Kalne, ci wua ki kunu, wuwot wa i Kamat en taun maditi; ka dok wucit piny i Gat taun madit pa jo Piliciti. Gin gibeco makato kerwu woko ce? Nyo wutamoni lobogi lac makato lobowu bo? <verse eid="AMO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 6:3" />Wun pe wuye ni nino marac tye kabino, ento wutye katiyo tic ma nyiko ninonu kelo cok mada. <verse eid="AMO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 6:4" />Can iwi jo ma gibutu iwi kitanda ma kideyo ki lak lyec! Wuryene iwi komwu mayom, wucamo lutino romi, ki roci ma kipito i dwol; <verse eid="AMO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 6:5" />wuwero werwu kun wulubu dwon nanga, wuroto gin goyo wer manyen me agoya calo Daudi. <verse eid="AMO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 6:6" />Wumato kongo bwino ki awalkwon, dok bene wuwiro komwu ki moo ma ngwece kur, ento cwinywu pe cwer pi topaco pa Icrael. <verse eid="AMO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 6:7" />Pieno wun wubibedo jo mukwongo me atera i opii, ci karamawu bigik woko.<verse eid="AMO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 6:8" />Rwot Lubanga ma en Rwot me mony dong okwonge ki nyinge kene ni, “Iya okwero wake pa Yakobo, akwero bene odine madongoni woko. Dong abimiyo taun maditi bot lakwore, kacel ki gin ducu matye iye.”<verse eid="AMO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 6:9" />Ka dano apar gudong i ot acel ci gibito. <verse eid="AMO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 6:10" />Lacen wat pa latoni, ma en aye myero oyike ilyel, bitingo kome pi kelo woko ki i ot. Ci wat pa latoni bipenyo ngat mo keken ma odong i ot kun waco ni, “Pud tye ngat mo ma odong i ot boti kenyo?” Ci dwon bigamo ni, “Peke.” Ci wat pa latoni biwaco ni, “Ling litik! Omyero wagwoke mada wek pe walok kadiwa nying Rwot.”<verse eid="AMO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 6:11" />Ka Rwot dok biciko, ci kibitwomo odi madito ki matino, ci kinginyogi woko ma tinotino. <verse eid="AMO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 6:12" />Aguragura tika giringo ikom pata? Tika kipuru nam ki kweri dyang? Ento wun wuloko ngolo kop atir odoko kwir, tim ma atir wuweko odoko gin marac, <verse eid="AMO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 6:13" />wun jo ma wutye kaum pi mako taun me Lo-debar, ki ma wuwake ni, “Wamako Kamaim pi tekowa kenwa.”<verse eid="AMO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 6:14" />Pieno, abiilo rok mukene ikomwu, wun jo Icrael ci gibiunuwu nia ki i yoo me donyo i Kamat nio kwede wa i kulu ma i Araba. Man lok pa an Rwot ma Lubanga me mony kikome.<verse eid="AMO 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="AMO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me Bonyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 7:1" />Rwot Lubanga onyuta man: ci aneno en tye kacweyo lwak bonyo ikare ma dong kityeko nyaro lum me acama pa dyangi pa rwot ci lum onongo dong ocako lot tyen me aryo. <verse eid="AMO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 7:2" />Ikare ma dong gutyeko camo lum woko ki i lobo, ci awaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga, timgi kica do! Likwayo pa Yakobo gitwero cung ningning ma kun gin ginok adada dok gigoro!”<verse eid="AMO 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 7:3" />Ci Rwot oloko tame ikom lok man kun waco ni, “Gin ma inenoni pe dong bitime.”<verse eid="AMO 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me mac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 7:4" />Rwot Lubanga dok onyuta lanyut mukene: ci aneno, Rwot Lubanga onongo tye kaciko ni kingol kop ikom jone ki mac; ci mac owango kut matut otyeko woko, ka dok ocako wango lobo bene. <verse eid="AMO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 7:5" />Ci awaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga, dong iwek do! Likwayo pa Yakobo gitwero cung ningning, ma kun gin ginok mo dok gigoro bene adada?”<verse eid="AMO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 7:6" />Ci Rwot Lubanga dok oloko tame ikom man kun waco ni, “Man bene pe dong bitime.”<verse eid="AMO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me birigi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 7:7" />Man dok gin ma Rwot onyuta: aneno Rwot ocung inget cel me gang ma kigero kun kipimo ki birigi. Rwot onongo omako birigi i cinge. <verse eid="AMO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 7:8" />Ci Rwot openya ni, “Amoc, ineno gin ango?” Ci agamo ni, “Birigi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 7:8">Dok Rwot owaca ni, “Nen, atye katic ki birigi me nyutu ni jona gubedo calo cel ma kicweyo ma ogom. Pe dok abiloko tama ikom pwod ma abipwodogi kwede. <verse eid="AMO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 7:9" />Kabedo ducu pa likwayo Icaka mayam giwora iye iwi godi kibibalogi woko. Kabedo maleng ducu pa jo Icrael bidong obur. Abicwalo lumerok ka lweny ikom lobo ci gibityeko jo me ot pa rwot Jeroboam woko liweng ki pala lucwan.”<verse eid="AMO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amoc ki Amajia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 7:10" />Ci Amajia, ajwaka me Betel, ocwalo lok bot Jeroboam, rwot me Icrael, ni, “Amoc tye kapiro lok ikomi, ikin jo Icrael; oweko lobo man pe twero ciro lwak lok ducu ma en owaco. <verse eid="AMO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 7:11" />Pien Amoc dong owaco kumeno ni, ‘Kibineko Jeroboam woko ki pala lucwan, ci kibikwanyo jo Icrael ki i lobogi ci kiterogi i opii.’”<verse eid="AMO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 7:12" />Ci Amajia owaco bot Amoc ni, “In lanebi, dok cen i lobo Juda, wek inong culi ki kunu, itit lok nebi bene ki kunu. <verse eid="AMO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 7:13" />Ento pe dok itit lok nebi i Betel, pien kany kabedo pa rwot, ot ma en woro iye Lubanga me ker man.”<verse eid="AMO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 7:14" />Amoc odok iye ki Amajia ni, “An pe lanebi, an bene pe atye i dul pa lanebi mo; ento yam an lakwat, ki layub nyig olam me acama. <verse eid="AMO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 7:15" />Ci Rwot okwanya ki kalubu kor romi, ci owaca ni, ‘Cit itit loka bot jona jo Icrael.’ <verse eid="AMO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 7:16" />Pimeno, koni dong iwiny lok pa Rwot. In iwaco ni, ‘Pe itit lok pa Lubanga ikom Icrael,’ dok ni, ‘Pe ibed kalok ikom ot pa Icaka.’ <verse eid="AMO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 7:17" />Pimeno, Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Dakoni bidoko malaya i gang, dok awobeni ki anyirani kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan. Potiwu kibipoko woko kun kipimo ki tol; dok in kikomi ibito i lobo pa lurok, ki jo Icrael kibikwanyogi woko ki i lobogi, ci kibiterogi i opii ada.’”<verse eid="AMO 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="AMO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me aduku ma opong ki nyig yadi me acama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 8:1" />Man aye ginanyuta me angwen ma Rwot Lubanga onyuta. Aneno, aduku matye iye nyig yadi me acama ma gicek i agiki mwaka. <verse eid="AMO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 8:2" />Ci Rwot openya ni, “Amoc, ineno gin ango?” Ci agamo ni, “Aduku matye iye nyig yadi me acama ma gicek i agiki mwaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 8:2">Ci Rwot dok owaca ni, “Agiki dong oo ikom jona jo Icrael; pe dok abiloko tama ikom pwod ma abiketo ikomgi. <verse eid="AMO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 8:3" />Inino meno wer me Ot pa Lubanga bidoko me koko. Kom jo ma oto bibedo mapol. Dong iling mot.”<verse eid="AMO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto ikom lobo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 8:4" />Wuwiny man, wun ma wunyono jo ma piny obwoyogi, ki ma wumito tyeko lucan woko ki i lobo. <verse eid="AMO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 8:5" />Wun wuwaco ni, “Karama me Por Dwe bitum awene, wek wacat belwa? Cabit kono bigik awene, wek wakel nganowa me acata?” Kun wupiro lok ni, “Wek wacat nganowa ki agwata matidi, wapim limgi ki cekel mapek, kun wabumu dano ki mijan ma pe pimo kakare. <verse eid="AMO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 8:6" />Wabicato ngano maracu i wel ma lamal. Wabinongo ngat ma piny oloyo ma pe romo culu banyane, ci wabiwile doko opiiwa i wel me war tyen keken.”<verse eid="AMO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 8:7" />Rwot ma jo Icrael wake kwede otyeko kwongo kwong ni, “Wiya pe biwil ikom timgi maracu ma gitimo. <verse eid="AMO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 8:8" />Ci lobo biyenge pi lok man, kun cwiny ngat acel acel matye i lobo bingabe angaba pi koko cane. Lobo ducu bitwage malo macalo kulu Nail ma opong, bitwage dok piny calo kulu Nail ma i Ejipt. <verse eid="AMO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 8:9" />Kare bibino ma ceng bipoto i cwiny dyeceng, abicido lobo woko ikare ma ceng ryeny. An Rwot me mony dong atyeko loko man. <verse eid="AMO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 8:10" />Abiloko ninowu madito ducu doko nino me kwero cola, ki werwu me yomcwiny bidoko wer kumu. Abimiyo jo ducu tweyo bongo cola i pyergi, ki wi dano ducu kibilyelo woko; ci wubibedo calo dano ma koko latine ma onywalo acel keken, agikine bibedo nino me cwercwiny madwong.”<verse eid="AMO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 8:11" />Rwot Lubanga dok owaco ni, “Kare bibino ma abicwalo kec i lobo man, pe kec kwon, onyo orwo pii, ento kec ki orwo me winyo lok pa Rwot.<verse eid="AMO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 8:12" />Dano bimal ata nia ki i Nam me Kado nio wa i Nam Mediterranean, ki nia ki tung kumalo nio tung kupiny; gibiringo ata pi yenyo lok pa Rwot, ento pe gibinongo. <verse eid="AMO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 8:13" />Inino meno anyira ma gibeco ki lutino awobe komgi biloc woko pi orwo pii. <verse eid="AMO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 8:14" />Jo meno ma gikwongo kwong ki nying Acima me Camaria, ma giwaco ni, ‘Macalo lubanga me Dan tye makwoni,’ dok ni, ‘Macalo lubanga me Beer-ceba tye makwoni,’ gibipoto piny ma pe gibia malo matwal.”<verse eid="AMO 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="AMO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop pa Lubanga ikom Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 9:1" />Yam aneno Rwot ocung inget keno tyer, ci owaco ni, “Go wi lubele me wir, wek rii dogola oyenge, turgi woko, wek ma onginyene oo iwi dano ducu. Ci jo ma gudong ki ikin gi abinekogi woko ki pala lucwan. Ngat acel mo ikin gi pe biringo, dano acel mo pe bibwot. <verse eid="AMO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 9:2" />Kadi bed gukwiny kakanegi piny ibur lyel matut, ci abikwanyogi woko ki kunu ki cinga; kadi bed guit malo i polo, ci abiomogi woko ki kunu adwokogi piny; <verse eid="AMO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 9:3" />kadi bed gukane iwi got Karmel, ci abiyenyogi ki kunu, amakogi woko; kadi bed gukane ki bota wa ite nam, ci abiciko twol ki kunu tongogi. <verse eid="AMO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 9:4" />Kadi bed kiterogi i opii inyim lukworgi, ci abiciko wek kinekogi woko ki kunu ki pala lucwan; ci abiketo wanga ikomgi pi timgi maracuni. Ayube me tyekogi ento pe pi konyogi.”<verse eid="AMO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 9:5" />Rwot Lubanga me mony,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:5">ka ogudu lobo, ci oyengyeng time,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:5">ci jo ducu ma gibedo iwi lobo gikok;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:5">lobo ducu twage atwaga calo kulu Nail ma opong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:5">ci twage calo kulu Nail ma i Ejipt.<verse eid="AMO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 9:6" />En gero kicikane mamalo i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:6">kun miyo dane gule iwi lobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:6">en lwongo pii me nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:6">ci coro woko iwi lobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:6">Nyinge Rwot.<verse eid="AMO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 9:7" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Wun jo Icrael, an aparo pirwu marom aroma ki kit ma aparo pi jo Etiopia. Yam akwanyowu ki i lobo Ejipt, i yo acelu bene yam akwanyo jo Lupiliciti ki i Kaptor, ki jo Ciria ki i Kir. <verse eid="AMO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 9:8" />Nen, an Rwot Lubangawu atye kaneno kerwu matye ki bal, ma abijwero woko ki iwi lobo ento pe abityeko likwayo pa Yakobo ducu.<verse eid="AMO 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 9:9" />Pien nen, abiciko, ci abiyengo ot pa Icrael ki ikin rok mukene ducu, calo ngat ma kiyo moko ki keikei, abiyeko jo Icrael maracu ducu. <verse eid="AMO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 9:10" />Lubalo ducu ma ikin jona kibinekogi ki pala lucwan, gin jo ma giwaco ni, ‘Gin marac mo pe bipoto ikomwa, ariya mo pe binen inyimwa.’”<verse eid="AMO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot bidwoko gum pa jo Icrael botgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:16-18">Tic 15:16-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Nino tye kabino ma abiroco ker pa Daudi mayam opoto macalo ot ma omuk. Abiyubu guti mayam omuki woko. Kama yam obaleni abiilone malo dok kakare. Abirocone odoco bedo kit macalo yam con. <verse eid="AMO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 9:12" />Ci jo Icrael biloyo lobo pa jo Edom mayam odong, ki rok ducu mayam onongo kilwongogi ki nyinga. Man an Rwot kikoma aye abitiyo.<verse eid="AMO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 9:13" />Kare tye kabino ma camwu bicek ma kac biromo ki wadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">kare me nyono olok biromo ki wadi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">Kongo bwino manyen bicwer ki iwi godi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">bimol iwi godi matino ducu.<verse eid="AMO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 9:14" />Abidwoko jona jo Icrael cen i lobogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">ci gibigero taun gi madito mayam obaleni woko odoco, gibedo iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">gibipito olok, ci gibimato kongo bwinone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">gibipuru poti, ci gibicamo cam ma ocek iye.<verse eid="AMO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 9:15" />Abipitogi i lobogi, ci gibimoko macalo yat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:15">ci pe dok kibiputugi woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:15">ki i lobo ma dong amiyo botgi.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:15">Man lok pa an Rwot Lubangawu kikome.<verse eid="AMO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 9" />
</usx>